{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100211","id":2224334717,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ElKd9","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100211","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100211.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100211.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100211","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100211/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100211/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100211/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2791288ef433c6c53b4802b8d7ed34045eb25001","number":100211,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add Depth Offset property to BaseMaterial3D and fix collision shape gizmo flicker","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Follow-up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90644.\r\n\r\nThis has several use cases:\r\n\r\n- Prevent collision shape gizmos that overlap with geometry from Z-fighting, which causes flickering in motion.\r\n- Draw meshes that overlap other meshes without Z-fighting, which is useful for mesh-based decals (without needing to offset them from the surface manually).\r\n- In general, allow meshes to draw in front of other meshes even if they're actually slightly behind, which can be useful for some VFX.\r\n- This paves the way for implementing https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1000.\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99184.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_depth_offset.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18065679/test_depth_offset.zip)\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n### Debug collisions\r\n\r\n#### Without depth offset\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20241209_182031](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2393266b-bbb3-4fe1-b74a-24a4dd0cfd81)\r\n\r\n#### With depth offset\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20241209_181943](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6a84542-c4a5-48ce-933e-0b7a3eb4efd0)\r\n\r\n### Debug collisions (supersampled)\r\n\r\n*2.0 render scale + 8x MSAA 3D.*\r\n\r\n#### Without depth offset\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20241209_182121](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8f85e8fd-1aae-4620-b6c5-dd6bd7ea4cae)\r\n\r\n#### With depth offset\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20241209_182143](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32bd19b0-96f2-4d2f-af6a-ba9d603efa7e)\r\n\r\n### Debug collisions in motion\r\n\r\n### Without depth offset\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47b6d731-592c-4108-85b4-20f49b20844c\r\n\r\n#### With depth offset\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/815a81ec-3cb8-4c53-8055-9c3536d19afa\r\n\r\n### CSG node gizmos\r\n\r\n#### Without depth offset\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20241209_184914](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6906c537-41e4-48c7-8ae4-f731c008bee4)\r\n\r\n#### With depth offset\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20241209_184954](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7914267-7e30-4153-bb11-c7fb680d7c89)\r\n\r\n### Mesh-based decal\r\n\r\n*Both planes are at the same height as the box they're resting on (no offset is applied to the mesh's vertices).*\r\n\r\n#### Without depth offset\r\n\r\n*Z-fighting occurs and is most visible when the camera moves or rotates.*\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20241209_183330](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/799e573c-7ede-4e29-9bb4-ee3d29846d68)\r\n\r\n#### With depth offset\r\n\r\n*No more Z-fighting.*\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20241209_183336](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e569512-eb98-401d-baab-51438e176a25)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone